WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:14.734
We were so tired from the wedding, so we went to the zoo to get some fresh air.

2
00:00:14.735 --> 00:00:17.855
Mom: Now, stay close and listen to me.

3
00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:20.014
Hana & Bada: Okay, Mommy.

4
00:00:20.015 --> 00:00:22.697
Bada: Let's see the tigers!

5
00:00:22.698 --> 00:00:26.592
Mom: Come back here, kids!

6
00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.934
Bada: Look at the tigers!

7
00:00:28.935 --> 00:00:31.471
They're so big!

8
00:00:31.472 --> 00:00:34.186
Mom: Don't lean against the cage!

9
00:00:34.187 --> 00:00:35.959
Hana: Come here, kitty.

10
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.948
Mom: Don't put your hand in the cage!

11
00:00:39.949 --> 00:00:42.996
Hana: Look at the elephants!

12
00:00:42.997 --> 00:00:45.359
Mom: Don't feed the animals!

13
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.416
Hana: Oh, sorry.

14
00:00:47.417 --> 00:00:51.977
Bada: Do you want some peanuts instead, Mommy?

15
00:00:51.978 --> 00:00:54.247
Bada: Look at the monkeys!

16
00:00:54.248 --> 00:00:56.924
They're so funny!

17
00:00:56.925 --> 00:00:59.299
Hana: I want to touch them!

18
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.036
Mom: Don't touch the monkeys!

19
00:01:02.037 --> 00:01:04.145
Oh, my hat!

20
00:01:04.146 --> 00:01:07.604
Mom: Give that back to me!

21
00:01:07.605 --> 00:01:10.452
Mom: Don't you want to eat anything?

22
00:01:10.453 --> 00:01:15.215
Hana: Whenever we do something, you always say "DON'T."

23
00:01:15.216 --> 00:01:19.309
Bada: Yeah, so we don't want to do anything.

24
00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:25.331
Mom: I'm sorry. From now on, I'll say "DO."

25
00:01:25.332 --> 00:01:27.500
Mom: Did you have a good time?

26
00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:29.368
Hana & Bada: Yes, Mommy.

27
00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:32.012
Mom: I'm sorry I was so mean.

28
00:01:32.013 --> 00:01:37.310
Hana: We love you!

29
00:01:37.311 --> 00:01:42.648
Mommy was so tired, but she still took us to the zoo.

30
00:01:42.649 --> 00:01:45.699
We had a good time with her.
